{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Smart Title 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 会话标题插件。它接入 sessionTitle 标题提供方，并在首条消息和对话轮次结束时调用 LLM 总结会话转写来生成标题。主要功能包括根据用户消息与助手回答生成标题、限制短时间内重复刷新、冻结过长会话的自动更新、保留用户手动修改的标题，以及可选回填仍为默认文案的活跃会话。设置页可以调整标题长度、模型路由、刷新间隔和回填选项。适合希望标题随会话主题自动更新、便于识别历史会话的 DSH Web 用户；需要宿主可用的 LLM 路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:577-679","src/index.js:684-743","src/index.js:817-849","client/index.js:210-345"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Smart Title adds automatic session titles to the DSH web client. Its title provider uses the host LLM to summarize transcripts on the first message and after completed turns. Settings control model routing, refresh limits, and optional backfill; user-renamed titles are preserved.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:577-679","src/index.js:684-743","src/index.js:817-849","client/index.js:210-345"]}
