{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#feature-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Smart Title 的功能「按对话生成标题」：读取会话转写并请求宿主 LLM 总结为标题。首条消息可触发即时生成，完成的对话轮次也可触发刷新；可配置是否包含助手回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:577-653","src/index.js:724-743"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#feature-2","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Smart Title 的功能「控制刷新频率」：会话标题生成后，在设定的最小间隔内跳过后续自动刷新，并可在用户消息数超过阈值时冻结轮次刷新。设置页可以配置间隔与阈值。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:696-704","client/index.js:330-341"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#feature-3","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Smart Title 的功能「保护手动标题」：检测到会话标题来源为用户修改时，不再用自动生成的结果覆盖它。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:577-679"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-smart-title#feature-4","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-smart-title","commit":"381d2507fa4d8f2eaf98ea34ccde49aec0719556","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Smart Title 的功能「启动回填」：启用后，扫描活跃会话并筛出仍使用 fallback 标题的会话，按配置数量和间隔逐个触发刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:817-849"]}
